906: ### 5.4 Truncation & Edge-Case Boundaries
907: | Scenario | Input Buffer | Expected Behavior |
908: |---|---|---|
909: | OSD 0-byte payload | `&[]` | `Err(FlightReaderError::MalformedPayload { record_type: 1, .. })` |
910: | OSD 52-byte payload | `&[0u8; 52]` | `Err(FlightReaderError::MalformedPayload { record_type: 1, .. })` |
911: | OSD exact 53-byte payload | `&[0u8; 53]` | `Ok(OsdRecord)` |
912: | OSD extended 57-byte payload | `&[0u8; 57]` | `Ok(OsdRecord)` |
913: | Home 0-byte payload | `&[]` | `Err(FlightReaderError::MalformedPayload { record_type: 2, .. })` |
914: | Home 45-byte payload | `&[0u8; 45]` | `Err(FlightReaderError::MalformedPayload { record_type: 2, .. })` |
915: | Home exact 46-byte payload | `&[0u8; 46]` | `Ok(HomeRecord)` |
916: | Home index 0 | `data_recorder_file_index = 0` | `dat_file_name() == None` |
917: | Home index 1 | `data_recorder_file_index = 1` | `dat_file_name() == Some("FLY001.DAT")` |
918: | Zero coordinates | `lat_rad = 0.0, lon_rad = 0.0` | `is_valid_coordinates() == false` (Clean uncalibrated state) |
919: | Speed saturation | `raw_vx = 32767` | `x_speed_mps == 3276.7` (No arithmetic overflow) |
920: | Heading wrap | `raw_yaw = -1` ($-0.1^\circ$) | `yaw_360() == 359.9` |
